    },
    "atom::e6ae378cdebe54c3509e6ded": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e6ae378cdebe54c3509e6ded",
      "source_handle": "P0096",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，聚焦于肠道微生物组、肺部微生物组及其代谢产物与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及毒性的关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc086d4a1134bbaccb95c2ed9dfc05e5af2dd0837c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a44c56ae006c315a0908beaebd2b1561b38a1979b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e6a1176ec0d75401b7009eecee9d6127d17db9e26",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fc65492cae7443b7968f589ce82f918b086897c1342813a4d1ecad8bf35c04a7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1104e373c7cd8897267cf2ff": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1104e373c7cd8897267cf2ff",
      "source_handle": "P0096",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统梳理了肠道和肺部微生物组作为预测生物标志物及辅助治疗策略在NSCLC免疫治疗中的应用现状。文章首先回顾了抗生素（ATB）和质子泵抑制剂（PPI）等合并用药对微生物组的破坏作用及其对ICI疗效的负面影响；其次，总结了多项临床研究中确定的与ICI响应相关的特定细菌特征（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Faecalibacterium等）；最后，评估了通过粪便微生物移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元、饮食干预及噬菌体疗法等调节微生物组的潜在治疗手段及其临床试验进展。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc086d4a1134bbaccb95c2ed9dfc05e5af2dd0837c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a44c56ae006c315a0908beaebd2b1561b38a1979b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e6a1176ec0d75401b7009eecee9d6127d17db9e26",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::67b130aeecf3cde6ec9b09be42bb2ee3c093561954a499f15ebf32d01646c5b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ca785efd9ba32135f81df350": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ca785efd9ba32135f81df350",
      "source_handle": "P0096",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节固体肿瘤（特别是NSCLC）中的ICI疗效提供了全面的背景素材。它涵盖了从生物标志物识别（哪些菌有益/有害）到干预策略（FMT、益生菌、饮食）的完整链条，特别强调了抗生素使用的危害和特定菌属（如Akkermansia）的双刃剑效应。可用于构建综述中关于“微生物组作为预测因子”、“环境因素（药物/饮食）的影响”以及“微生物组靶向治疗”的核心章节。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc086d4a1134bbaccb95c2ed9dfc05e5af2dd0837c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a44c56ae006c315a0908beaebd2b1561b38a1979b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::909e93d69c5a110886797e4e6a1176ec0d75401b7009eecee9d6127d17db9e26",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5964ff5fc7d8220217244c6bfb883bb20b32e3eb8e4a63c035d1fcd1625e241a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::18206f6807254bace51a9dab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::18206f6807254bace51a9dab",
      "source_handle": "P0096",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究和回顾性队列，因果关系需结合机制研究确认。不同研究间的菌属定义可能存在技术差异（16S vs WGS）。",
        "contribution": "提供了NSCLC患者中与ICI响应和非响应相关的特定微生物特征列表。例如，响应者富集Akkermansia muciniphila, Faecalibacterium prausnitzii, Bifidobacterium spp., Blautia等；非响应者富集Parabacteroides, Fusobacterium, Hungatella等。同时指出了A. muciniphila丰度过高的潜在风险。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9577f4b99b0d1e6b2a5a3adc086d4a1134bbaccb95c2ed9dfc05e5af2dd0837c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::769a855a4ccae40446adf28a44c56ae006c315a0908beaebd2b1561b38a1979b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
