      "variant_group": "field::3e4db203717687e108f548f07c9fdbc1647b53cfb60a5cc44590d59e266f3364",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4d32c7c4fc57964f4eca5feb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4d32c7c4fc57964f4eca5feb",
      "source_handle": "P0585",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫治疗改变了NSCLC的治疗格局，但缺乏可靠的生物标志物来指导治疗选择。肠道微生物群虽被视为潜在生物标志物，但其在NSCLC化疗-免疫联合治疗中的具体作用尚不清楚。本研究试图回答：肠道微生物群的组成和多样性是否能预测晚期NSCLC患者在接受不同化疗-免疫联合方案时的预后（OS）和治疗安全性（严重AEs）？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b48b92078f04672f80082d0088935adb6508549e41039f2b01120655f16c11f8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6a5534688a594702c4f82ac666f1a616a367ec3ff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee4f009c0257a9e0193c58b79ea0bb07b70725992b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b00ec5d1f8521134a7ce57c1ef52a00a007fec0dbb9b0cfb8a70ce6c28234207",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::11588e401bbf4877af15cff5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::11588e401bbf4877af15cff5",
      "source_handle": "P0585",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对无驱动基因改变的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，基于JCOG2007（NIPPON）III期临床试验的辅助生物标志物研究。研究对象为接受培美曲塞+铂类化疗联合帕博利珠单抗（PC组）或纳武利尤单抗+伊匹木单抗联合铂类化疗（NIC组）的患者，分析基线粪便样本中的肠道微生物群。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b48b92078f04672f80082d0088935adb6508549e41039f2b01120655f16c11f8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6a5534688a594702c4f82ac666f1a616a367ec3ff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee4f009c0257a9e0193c58b79ea0bb07b70725992b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6737867160b777dac3056be874a12f1a470932b927a1cc050624c5227159048f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::64bc295bd46b3e9847e3a952": {
      "atom_id": "atom::64bc295bd46b3e9847e3a952",
      "source_handle": "P0585",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物群作为晚期NSCLC化疗-免疫治疗疗效和安全性生物标志物的潜力。研究利用JCOG2007试验中270名有基线粪便样本患者的16S rDNA测序数据，分析了微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度与总生存期（OS）及严重不良事件（AEs）之间的关联。结果显示，微生物结构随生存时间延长而变化，特定产丁酸菌属富集于长生存患者，且与较低的严重AE风险相关；此外，不同治疗方案下微生物对预后的影响存在差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b48b92078f04672f80082d0088935adb6508549e41039f2b01120655f16c11f8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::33eb067b80204dcb68c3dbc6a5534688a594702c4f82ac666f1a616a367ec3ff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::4debf19bd260cc81e2d804ee4f009c0257a9e0193c58b79ea0bb07b70725992b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0757aa4d45bdb283cbe5c51531158a8f47d880ec33425a302e1144883dba8a76",
